msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "正在儲存…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:150
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr "已儲存：PC5開啟時會重新取得封面、背景和詳細資料。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:151
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "已清除：PC5會重新讀取遊戲的資料夾。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153 title/pc5_web_page.html:178
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:266
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "未儲存：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:156
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "；GOG產品%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:157
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5依據這個編號（%s%s）選擇遊戲的封面、背景和詳細資料。如果它們屬於另一款遊戲，請輸入該遊戲Steam商店連結中的編號（store.steampowered.com/app/<編號>）。留空：PC5會重新讀取資料夾。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:176
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "已儲存：將在遊戲下次啟動時使用。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:189
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Files: change a game's text files"
msgstr "檔案：變更遊戲的文字檔"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:194
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "遊戲資料夾"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:194
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows（登錄檔、存檔、設定）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:222
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "此資料夾是空的"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:233
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "大於 8 MB：太大，無法在這裡變更"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:237
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "無法顯示：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:251
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "含 BOM 的 UTF-8"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:252
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "西文（每個字母一個位元組）"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr "%s · %s 換行 · %d 行 · %s。按原樣儲存：編碼和換行符號不變。遊戲在下次啟動時讀取。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:263
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "已儲存。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:271
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "不儲存變更就關閉？"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:276
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr "Wine 會在遊戲執行時寫入 .reg 檔：請只在沒有遊戲執行時變更它們。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "無法開啟：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:281
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr "僅限文字檔（.ini、.cfg、.txt、.json、.reg 等），最大 8 MB。主機上的檔案管理員也能逐行變更。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:292
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "還沒有遊戲。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:295
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB儲存裝置"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:296
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "無法啟動"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:301
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "設定：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:304
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "最新記錄檔"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "回報問題"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:307
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr "下載最新的記錄檔並開啟已填好的GitHub表單：請在那裡附上記錄檔。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:313
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "啟動選項（launch.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:314
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr "第一個非空白且非註解（#或;）的行會加到程式的命令列中。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:318
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "環境變數（env.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:318
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "每行一個NAME=value，在遊戲啟動前設定。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:319
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "額外記錄（winedebug.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr "只在問題回報要求時使用，例如err+all,+seh。用完後請清空：它會拖慢遊戲。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:325
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "遊戲未能載入：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:338
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "沒有保留任何記錄檔。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:342
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "出現過問題"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:345
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "記錄檔未能載入：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:354
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "連線已中斷"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:371
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sending %d of %d: %s"
msgstr "正在傳送%d/%d：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:375
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Stopped at %s: %s"
msgstr "在%s處停止：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:382
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sent %d files (%s). PC5 asks to install the game in a moment."
msgstr "已傳送%d個檔案（%s）。PC5稍後會詢問是否安裝這款遊戲。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:391
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Type the game's folder name first (no / or \\)."
msgstr "請先輸入遊戲的資料夾名稱（不能包含/或\\）。"

#~ msgid "Maximum: all of it, for a game that says there is too little."
#~ msgstr "最大：全部，適用於提示記憶體太少的遊戲。"

#~ msgid "Loading"
#~ msgstr "載入中"

#~ msgid "Wine's VKD3D"
#~ msgstr "Wine的VKD3D"

#~ msgid "WineD3D on Vulkan"
#~ msgstr "基於Vulkan的WineD3D"

#~ msgid "SoC temperature"
#~ msgstr "SoC溫度"

#~ msgid "Its program is set in its prospero-win profile."
#~ msgstr "它的程式是在prospero-win設定檔中設定的。"

#~ msgid "Hides when unused"
#~ msgstr "不使用時隱藏"

#~ msgid "Game controlled"
#~ msgstr "由遊戲控制"

#~ msgid "Wine's own Direct3D draws it; change it only if the picture is wrong"
#~ msgstr "由Wine內建的Direct3D繪製；只在畫面異常時變更"

#~ msgid "Wine's own Direct3D 12; if it doesn't help, set it back to Auto"
#~ msgstr "Wine內建的Direct3D 12；如果沒有改善，請改回「自動」"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wine's own Direct3D on Vulkan; if it doesn't help, set it back to Auto"
#~ msgstr "基於Vulkan的Wine內建Direct3D；如果沒有改善，請改回「自動」"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wine's own Direct3D on OpenGL; if it doesn't help, set it back to Auto"
#~ msgstr "基於OpenGL的Wine內建Direct3D；如果沒有改善，請改回「自動」"

#~ msgid "Graphics API"
#~ msgstr "圖形API"

#~ msgid "As Windows: 4 GB for a game made for it, otherwise 2 GB"
#~ msgstr "與Windows相同：為此設計的遊戲4 GB，其他2 GB"

#~ msgid "Video memory"
#~ msgstr "顯示記憶體"

#~ msgid "2 GB at most, a number older games' checks can read"
#~ msgstr "最多2 GB，舊遊戲的檢查能讀取的數值"

#~ msgid "Full"
#~ msgstr "全部"

#~ msgid "CPU sharing"
#~ msgstr "CPU共用"

#~ msgid "Its threads take turns, as on a PC: steadier for some games"
#~ msgstr "執行緒輪流執行，與電腦上一樣：某些遊戲會更穩定"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
#~ "fastest, and what most games want."
#~ msgstr "PC5的選擇：VKD3D-Proton將遊戲的Direct3D 12轉換為Vulkan。速度最快，也最適合大多數遊戲。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
#~ msgstr "PC5的選擇：Wine內建的Direct3D用OpenGL繪製遊戲的DirectDraw。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
#~ "what most games want."
#~ msgstr "PC5的選擇：DXVK將遊戲的Direct3D轉換為Vulkan。速度最快，也最適合大多數遊戲。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
#~ "start or draws wrong."
#~ msgstr "Wine內建的Direct3D 12（VKD3D）。比「自動」慢；如果遊戲無法啟動或畫面異常，可以試試。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with Vulkan. Try it if the game draws wrong "
#~ "with Auto; often faster than WineD3D."
#~ msgstr "Wine內建的Direct3D，用Vulkan繪製。如果用「自動」時畫面異常，可以試試；通常比WineD3D快。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with OpenGL. The slowest; try it if the game "
#~ "won't start with the others."
#~ msgstr "Wine內建的Direct3D，用OpenGL繪製。速度最慢；如果遊戲用其他選項都無法啟動，可以試試。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A .NET program: it runs with Wine Mono, which PC5 sets up the first time a "
#~ ".NET game starts."
#~ msgstr ".NET程式：它透過Wine Mono執行，PC5會在第一次啟動.NET遊戲時安裝它。"

#~ msgid "Games players have tried, on your phone with a QR code"
#~ msgstr "玩家試過的遊戲，掃描QR碼在手機上查看"

#~ msgid "Focus mode"
#~ msgstr "專注模式"

#~ msgid "Shown"
#~ msgstr "顯示"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Scan the code with your phone: PC5's wiki opens on the list of games "
#~ "players have tried, how each ran and the settings that helped."
#~ msgstr "用手機掃描QR碼：PC5的Wiki會開啟玩家試過的遊戲清單，包括每款遊戲的執行情況和有幫助的設定。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "On your phone or computer, open "
#~ "github.com/bornaradusin/PC5/wiki/Game-compatibility: the games players "
#~ "have tried, how each ran and the settings that helped."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "在手機或電腦上開啟github.com/bornaradusin/PC5/wiki/Game-compatibility：玩家試過的遊戲、每款遊戲的執行情況和有幫助的設定。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Got a game running? Add a game, at the top of the list's page: the form "
#~ "takes a minute. You need a GitHub account."
#~ msgstr "有遊戲成功執行了嗎？在清單頁面頂端點「Add a game」：填寫表單只要一分鐘。您需要GitHub帳號。"

#~ msgid "Keep changing"
#~ msgstr "繼續變更"

#~ msgid "Vibration, light bar and triggers"
#~ msgstr "震動、燈條和扳機"

#~ msgid "Off. On holds the game at 30 fps and shows 60"
#~ msgstr "關。開啟後遊戲鎖定在30 fps並以60 fps顯示"
